 {"label": "A7 the server has both routes, the fixed one with three points and the relative one in metres", "eval": "fetch('/routes').then(r => r.json()).then(rs => rs.slice(-2).map(r => [r.id, r.name, r.points.length, r.offsets.map(o => [o.north_m, o.east_m])]))", "expect": [["new_route", "QA 고정 경로", 3, []], ["new_route-2", "QA 상대 경로", 0, [[300, 0], [300, -200]]]]},
